{"unit_id":"tag:0ADK:proof","translation":"注意<MATH_0001>，更高重的纤维积（fibre products）也类似。给出态射（morphism）<MATH_0002>恰好等同于给出族<MATH_0003>。而给出下降（descent）数据<MATH_0004>恰好等同于给出族<MATH_0005>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积","context":"更高重的乘积；待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"数据的等同；待决。"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"下降数据；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0ADL:statement","translation":"下降（descent）数据的拉回（Pullback）。令<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 令\n<MATH_0002>\n为代数空间（algebraic spaces）的交换图（commutative diagram），在<MATH_0003>上。构造\n<MATH_0004>\n其中<MATH_0005>，且<MATH_0006>定义为复合（composition）\n<MATH_0007>\n定义了一个函子（functor），从相对于<MATH_0008>的下降（descent）数据范畴（category）到相对于<MATH_0009>的下降（descent）数据范畴（category）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 给定两个态射（morphisms）<MATH_0010>、<MATH_0011>，使图（diagram）交换（commute），则函子（functors）<MATH_0012>和<MATH_0013>典范同构（canonically isomorphic）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"Pullback","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"commute","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"canonically isomorphic","target_term":"典范同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"下降数据；待决。"},{"source_term":"Pullback","target_term":"拉回","context":"数据的构造；待决。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基底；待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"对象类型；待决。"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图","context":"构造的参照；待决。"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合","context":"诱导映射；待决。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"数据的拉回；待决。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"数据范畴；待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"选择的映射；待决。