{"unit_id":"tag:0ADL:proof","translation":"我们省略(1)的证明，但指出态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>是态射（morphism）<MATH_0002>，这里使用注记<REF_0001>引入的记号。对于(2)，我们指出哪个态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>给出函子性同构（isomorphism）。也就是说，由于<MATH_0004>和<MATH_0005>都属于该交换图（commutative diagram），可见存在唯一的态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>满足<MATH_0007>。于是我们取\n<MATH_0008>\n我们省略这一构造适用的验证。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"函子性同构"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"诱导映射；待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"函子性同构","context":"函子间的同构；待决。"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图","context":"相容见证；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0ADM:statement","translation":"令<MATH_0001>如引理<REF_0001>中所述，则该引理中构造的函子（functor）\n<MATH_0002>\n称为下降（descent）数据上的<TEXTITOPEN_0001>拉回函子（pullback functor）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"pullback functor","target_term":"拉回函子"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"前述构造；待决。"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"函子的对象；待决。"},{"source_term":"pullback functor","target_term":"拉回函子","context":"所定义名称；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0ADN:statement","translation":"令<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。令<MATH_0002>和<MATH_0003>为具有固定目标的态射族（families of morphisms）。令<MATH_0004>、<MATH_0005>和<MATH_0006>为具有固定目标的映射（maps）族的态射（morphism），见《位点（Sites）》定义<REF_0001>。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 令<MATH_0007>为相对于族<MATH_0008>的下降（descent）数据。系统\n<MATH_0009>\n（记号如注记<REF_0002>中所述）是相对于<MATH_0010>的下降（descent）数据。\n<STRUCT_0003> 这一构造定义一个函子（functor），在相对于<MATH_0011>的下降（descent）数据范畴（category）与相对于<MATH_0012>的下降（descent）数据范畴（category）之间。\n<STRUCT_0004> 给定第二个<MATH_0013>、<MATH_0014>和<MATH_0015>，是具有固定目标的映射（maps）族的态射（morphism），若<MATH_0016>，则所得到的两个下降（descent）数据间的函子（functors）典范同构（canonically isomorphic）。\n<STRUCT_0005> 这些函子（functors）经引理<REF_0003>与引理<REF_0004>中构造的拉回函子（pullback functors）一致。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"families of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"canonically isomorphic","target_term":"典范同构"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"pullback functors","target_term":"拉回函子"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基底；待决。"},{"source_term":"families of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"参照的族；待决。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"族中的映射；待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"族之间的态射；待决。"},{"source_term":