{"unit_id":"tag:0ADP:statement","translation":"令<MATH_0001>、<MATH_0002>、<MATH_0003>、<MATH_0004>和<MATH_0005>如引理<REF_0001>中所述，则该引理中构造的函子（functor）\n<MATH_0006>\n称为下降（descent）数据上的<TEXTITOPEN_0001>拉回函子（pullback functor）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"pullback functor","target_term":"拉回函子"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"前述构造；待决。"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"函子的对象；待决。"},{"source_term":"pullback functor","target_term":"拉回函子","context":"所定义名称；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0ADF:prose-0004","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n若<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>具有同一目标<MATH_0003>，且<MATH_0004>加细<MATH_0005>（见《位点（Sites）》定义<REF_0001>），但未给出明确的对<MATH_0006>，则我们仍可讨论拉回（pullback）函子（functor），因为我们已在引理<REF_0002>中看到，这个对的选择无关紧要（在典范同构（canonical isomorphism）的意义下）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"canonical isomorphism","target_term":"典范同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点","context":"引用章名；待决。"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回","context":"构造的名称；待决。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"构造的类型；待决。"},{"source_term":"canonical isomorphism","target_term":"典范同构","context":"选择无关性的意义；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0ADQ:statement","translation":"令<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。令<MATH_0002>为代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism），在<MATH_0003>上。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 给定代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0004>在<MATH_0005>上，我们有<TEXTITOPEN_0001>平凡下降数据（trivial descent datum）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，属于<MATH_0006>、相对于<MATH_0007>，即<MATH_0008>上的恒等态射（identity morphism）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 由引理<REF_0001>，我们得到<TEXTITOPEN_0002>典范下降数据（canonical descent datum）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，在<MATH_0009>上、相对于<MATH_0010>，它由平凡下降数据（trivial descent datum）沿<MATH_0011>拉回得到。我们常用<MATH_0012>表示这个下降（descent）数据。\n<STRUCT_0004> 一个下降（descent）数据<MATH_0013>相对于<MATH_0014>，称为<TEXTITOPEN_0003>有效的（effective）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>，若<MATH_0015>同构（isomorphic）于典范下降数据（canonical descent datum）<MATH_0016>，后者来自某个代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0017>在<MATH_0018>上。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"trivial descent datum","target_term":"平凡下降数据"},{"source_term":"identity morphism","target_term":"恒等态射"},{"source_term":"canonical descent datum","target_term":"典范下降数据"},{"source_term":"trivial descent datum","target_term":"平凡下降数据"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"effective","target_term":"有效的"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"canonical descent datum","target_term":"典范下降数据"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基底；待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"对象类型；待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"下降参照；待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"下降对象；待决。"},{"source_term":"trivial descent datum","target_term":"平凡下降数据","context":"定义的对象；待决。"},{"source_term":"identity morphism","target_term":"恒等态射","context":"平凡数据；待决。"},{"source_term":"canonical descent datum","target_term":"典范下降数据","context":"拉回的数据；待决。"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"下降数据；待决。"},{"source_term":"effective","target_term":"有效的","context":"数据的有效性；待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构","context":"有效性条件；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0ADF:prose-0005","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n因此，有效意味着存在代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0001>在<MATH_0002>上，以及同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0003>在<MATH_0004>上，使得<MATH_0005>等于复合（composition）\n<MATH_0006>\n这里有一个小问题：当<MATH_0007>和<MATH_0008>是概形（schemes）时，这个定义（在精神上）与《下降（Descent）》定义<REF_0001>给出的定义冲突。不过，上下文总会明确我们指的是哪个版本。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"有效下降的对象；待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"有效性条件；待决。"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合","context":"相容条件；待决。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"比较情形；待决。"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降","context":"引用章名；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0ADR:statement","translation":"令<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。令<MATH_0002>为态射族（family of morphisms），它们是<MATH_0003>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射，具有固定目标<MATH_0004>。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 给定代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0005>在<MATH_0006>上，我们在代数空间（algebraic spaces）族<MATH_0007>上有<TEXTITOPEN_0001>典范下降数据（canonical descent datum）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，它由<MATH_0008>相对于<MATH_0009>的平凡下降（descent）数据拉回得到。我们将这个下降（descent）数据记为<MATH_0010>。\n<STRUCT_0003> 一个下降（descent）数据<MATH_0011>相对于<MATH_0012>，称为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>有效的（effective）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，若存在代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0013>在<MATH_0014>上，使得<MATH_0015>同构（isomorphic）于<MATH_0016>。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"canonical descent datum","target_term":"典范下降数据"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"effective","target_term":"有效的"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基底；待决。"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"下降参照；待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"对象类型；待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"下降对象；待决。"},{"source_term":"canonical descent datum","target_term":"典范下降数据","context":"所构造的数据；待决。"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"下降数据；待决。"},{"source_term":"effective","target_term":"有效的","context":"数据性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构","context":"有效性条件；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
