{"unit_id":"tag:0ADS:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节是《下降（Descent）》第<REF_0001>节的对应版本。由于代数空间（algebraic spaces）本身已经是层（sheaves），这里略有不同。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降","context":"引用章名；待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"本节对象；待决。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"对象的已有性质；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
